@startuml
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "Operations panel" as Workspace
participant "Mission workflow" as Planning
participant "Map rendering boundary" as Map
participant "Mission API adapter" as Api
participant "Backend contract" as Backend

Operator -> Workspace: Start new mission
Workspace -> Planning: Enter planning mode
Planning -> Map: Enable route drawing
Operator -> Map: Draw route
Map --> Planning: Candidate geometry

Planning -> Planning: Validate route and required fields
Planning -> Map: Show route revision preview
Operator -> Planning: Save draft
Planning -> Api: create(command)
Api -> Backend: POST mission
Backend --> Api: Draft mission + route revision
Api --> Planning: Mission
Planning -> Map: Display saved route
Planning --> Workspace: Return to inspection

Operator -> Workspace: Edit draft mission
Workspace -> Planning: Load mission
Planning -> Map: Enable modify/translate
Operator -> Map: Change route
Map --> Planning: New geometry
Planning -> Api: updateDraft(command)
Api -> Backend: PATCH draft mission
Backend --> Api: New immutable route revision
Api --> Planning: Updated mission

Operator -> Workspace: Plan mission
Workspace -> Api: plan(id, idempotencyKey)
Api -> Backend: Guarded plan command
Backend --> Api: Planned mission
Api --> Workspace: Planned state
@enduml
